# Files that are gitignored but must exist in a worktree for it to build and
# run. Without these, an isolated agent gets a checkout that cannot compile,
# and burns turns rediscovering why.
#
# DELIBERATELY ABSENT: .env.local, .env.production.local, .env.development.local.
# Those hold SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, HELM_PROD_POSTGRES_PASSWORD and
# HELM_PROD_DB_URL_DIRECT — live credentials for the SHARED production
# database. Copying them into every parallel worktree multiplies the number of
# places a live prod secret sits on disk by the number of agents you run. If a
# worktree genuinely needs to reach a database, give it scoped credentials
# explicitly rather than inheriting the founder's.

# Node version pin — the repo auto-switches via fnm; without it a worktree
# lands on the machine default (v26) while all 24 CI workflows pin 22.
.node-version

# Local editor/tooling config that is ignored but harmless and useful.
.vscode/settings.json
.vscode/extensions.json
